  "wikitext": "{{Short description|Species of shrub}}\n{{Speciesbox\n|image = FreyliniaLanceolata.jpg\n|image_caption = Flowers of ''Freylinia lanceolata'' in the Mediterranean Biome at the [[Eden Project]]\n|genus = Freylinia\n|species = lanceolata\n|authority = ([[L.f.]]) [[G.Don]]\n}}\n\n'''''Freylinia lanceolata''''' is a South African shrub belonging to the family [[Scrophulariaceae]].\n\nThis species prefers damp ground, riverbanks and marshy areas in the [[Western Cape]], through to the [[Eastern Cape]].\n\n==External links==\n*[http://www.plantzafrica.com/plantefg/freylinlan.htm ''Freylinia lanceolata''] {{Webarchive|url=https://web.archive.org/web/20120629003319/http://www.plantzafrica.com/plantefg/freylinlan.htm |date=2012-06-29 }}\n{{Commons category-inline|Freylinia lanceolata|''Freylinia lanceolata''}}\n\n{{Taxonbar|from=Q4492623}}\n\n[[Category:Freylinia|lanceolata]]\n[[Category:Shrubs]]\n\n\n{{Scrophulariaceae-stub}}",
